    "created_at": "2017-08-02T13:04:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-08-02T13:04:36Z",
    "body": "Sadly, it looks like there's not a single test involving the ended event in https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/tree/master/html/semantics/embedded-content/media-elements. Writing such a test might shed some light on the situation. Volunteers?",
